{"t":"TJX","made":"2026-11-20 01:31","name":"The TJX Companies, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Apparel Retail","employees":377000,"hq":"Framingham, MA, United States","website":"https://www.tjx.com","summary_en":"The TJX Companies, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, operates as an off-price apparel and home fashions retailer worldwide. It operates through four segments: Marmaxx, HomeGoods, TJX Canada, and TJX International. The company provides family apparel comprising footwear; accessories, such as beauty and jewelry; home fashion products, including home basics, decorative accessories and giftware, as well as furniture, rugs, lighting, soft home, decorative accessories, tabletop, and cookware; pet and gourmet food; and other merchandise. It also offers home decor, furniture, and seasonal home merchandise. The company sells its products through stores and e-commerce sites. The TJX Companies, Inc. was incorporated in 1962 and is headquartered in Framingham, Massachusetts.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"TJX Companies, Inc.는 자회사와 함께 전 세계적으로 할인 의류 및 가정 패션 소매업체로 운영되고 있습니다. Marmaxx, HomeGoods, TJX Canada 및 TJX International의 4개 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 신발로 구성된 가족 의류를 제공합니다. 미용 및 보석과 같은 액세서리; 가구, 양탄자, 조명, 소프트 홈, 장식용 액세서리, 테이블 상판 및 조리기구뿐만 아니라 홈 기본 제품, 장식용 액세서리 및 선물 용품을 포함한 홈 패션 제품; 애완동물 및 고급 식품; 및 기타 상품. 또한 가정 장식, 가구, 계절별 가정용품도 제공합니다. 회사는 상점과 전자상거래 사이트를 통해 제품을 판매합니다. TJX Companies, Inc.는 1962년에 설립되었으며 매사추세츠주 프레이밍햄에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":140.54,"mcap":154590347264.0,"pe":25.50635,"fpe":24.503273,"peg":2.4895,"ps":2.4461272,"pb":14.521594,"ev_ebitda":17.461,"div":1.37,"beta":null,"hi52":170.0,"lo52":122.78},"fin":{"rev":63197999104.0,"rev_g":0.055,"eps_g":0.086,"gross":0.32072,"op":0.12758,"net":0.097600006,"roe":0.61398,"fcf":4748125184.0,"cash":4609999872.0,"debt":13416999936.0,"de":125.007,"eps":5.51,"feps":5.73556},"own":{"short":0.0143,"inst":0.95154,"insider":0.00178},"analyst":{"n":19,"mean":164.52632,"median":170.0,"high":190.0,"